      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This humanoid creature has long, sharp teeth, and its pallid flesh is stretched tightly over its starved frame.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 14, touch 12, flat-footed 12 (+2 dex, +2 natural)</p><p>hp 25 [36] (3d8+12)</p><p>Fort +5, Ref +3, Will +5</p><p>Defensive Abilities Channel Resistance +2</p><p>Immune Undead Traits</p><p>Weakness Fire and Holy</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +5 (1d6+3 plus paralysis), 2 claws +5 (1d6+3)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Leech, Paralysis (1d4+1 rounds, Fort DC 15), Sickening Breath</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 17, Dex 15, Con -, Int 13, Wis 14, Cha 18</p><p>Base Atk +2; CMB +5; CMD 18</p><p>Feats Power Attack, Toughness</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +5, Climb +9, Perception +8, Stealth +8, Swim +6</p><p>Languages Common</p>"
